{"title":"Pale Hart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 170 total, 170 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×170</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-arms\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Arms - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1f32ba4ba4496e9683bd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-pale-hart\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e2e0b9d15c65806fed4f.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>The Pale Hart</b><span>Lv 42</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Moonbeast: <a href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">Glimmerfox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/moonhart\">Moonhart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/white-unicorn\">White Unicorn</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7368d760ade781ef7459.svg\" alt=\"Pale Hart\"></div><h3>Pale Hart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>42 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 42–42)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Moonbeast</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>212</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}